ing criticism, regarded as show-off. Strengths: technical competence, leadership, situational awareness. Weaknesses: cooperation, humility. Candidate D: responds to unexpected events adequately, concentrates well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, but regarded as arrogant, know-it-all. Strengths: problem solving, responsibility, concentration. Weaknesses: attitude.\n\nWe need to start discussion, maybe propose Candidate C as leading due to reliability and calmness, but note concerns about communication. Provide recommendation vote for C. Let's do that."}
